@startuml Paquetes - Gestion de entradas y salidas
title Gestion de entrada y salida de vehiculos - Diagrama de paquetes
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Frontend Angular" as Frontend {
  package "app.routes y app.config" as FrontendConfig
  package "features.parking" as ParkingFeature
  package "features.cells" as CellsFeature
  package "features.users" as UsersFeature
  package "features.contracts.contract-audit" as ContractAuditFeature
  package "core.auth.guard y auth.service" as AuthCore
  package "core.api-error.interceptor" as ErrorInterceptor
}

package "API FastAPI" as Backend {
  package "app.main" as MainApp
  package "app.routes.transits" as TransitRoutes
  package "app.routes.cells" as CellRoutes
  package "app.routes.contracts" as ContractRoutes
  package "app.routes.users" as UserRoutes
  package "app.auth" as AuthModule
  package "app.cash" as CashModule
  package "app.domain" as DomainModule
  package "app.contracts" as ContractLogic
  package "app.novelties" as NoveltyLogic
  package "app.database" as DatabaseModule
}

package "Persistencia MySQL" as Storage {
  package "autos_colombia" as Schema {
    package "users y user_sessions" as UsersTables
    package "contracts y vehicles" as ContractTables
    package "cells" as CellTables
    package "cash_openings" as CashTables
    package "transits" as TransitTables
    package "novelties" as NoveltyTables
  }
}

FrontendConfig ..> ParkingFeature : registra ruta protegida
FrontendConfig ..> AuthCore : configura guard y cliente HTTP
ParkingFeature ..> AuthCore : requiere sesion activa
ParkingFeature ..> ErrorInterceptor : HTTP con credenciales y errores
ParkingFeature ..> ContractRoutes : GET /api/contracts
ParkingFeature ..> CellRoutes : GET /api/cells
ParkingFeature ..> TransitRoutes : POST /api/transits/entry y exit
CellsFeature ..> CellRoutes : consulta estados y placa\nPATCH mantenimiento para Administrador
UsersFeature ..> UserRoutes : GET/POST /api/users\nAdministrador
ContractAuditFeature ..> ContractRoutes : GET /api/contracts/cancellations\nAdministrador
AuthCore ..> AuthModule : GET /api/auth/me

MainApp ..> TransitRoutes : registra router
MainApp ..> CellRoutes : registra router
MainApp ..> ContractRoutes : registra router
MainApp ..> UserRoutes : registra router
TransitRoutes ..> AuthModule : autentica usuario y administrador
TransitRoutes ..> CashModule : verifica caja del Operario
TransitRoutes ..> DomainModule : valida acceso y celda
TransitRoutes ..> ContractLogic : actualiza contratos vencidos
TransitRoutes ..> NoveltyLogic : persiste novedades
TransitRoutes ..> DatabaseModule : transaccion SQL
CellRoutes ..> AuthModule : autentica usuario
CellRoutes ..> DomainModule : filtra celdas compatibles
CellRoutes ..> DatabaseModule : consulta celdas
UserRoutes ..> AuthModule : exige Administrador
UserRoutes ..> DatabaseModule : consulta y crea cuentas
ContractRoutes ..> AuthModule : autentica usuario y rol
ContractRoutes ..> ContractLogic : consulta contratos y vencimientos
ContractRoutes ..> DatabaseModule : transaccion SQL
ContractRoutes ..> DatabaseModule : consulta auditoria de cancelaciones
AuthModule ..> DatabaseModule : consulta sesiones y usuarios
CashModule ..> DatabaseModule : consulta caja abierta
NoveltyLogic ..> DatabaseModule : inserta novedad

AuthModule ..> UsersTables : lee usuario y sesion
CashModule ..> CashTables : consulta apertura activa
TransitRoutes ..> ContractTables : consulta contrato y vehiculo
TransitRoutes ..> TransitTables : consulta historial e inserta transito
TransitRoutes ..> CellTables : bloquea y actualiza ocupacion
CellRoutes ..> CellTables : consulta disponibilidad
ContractRoutes ..> ContractTables : consulta contratos
NoveltyLogic ..> NoveltyTables : inserta novedad
DatabaseModule ..> Schema : MySQL Connector

note bottom of TransitRoutes
  La entrada y salida se ejecutan en transacciones.
  El registro de transito es inmutable.
  Antes de aceptar una entrada, el backend bloquea el vehiculo
  y valida su ultimo transito para serializar el Anti-Passback.
end note

note bottom of ParkingFeature
  El diagrama muestra dependencias del codigo actual:
  el frontend consume contratos y celdas; el listado de contratos
  informa si la placa esta dentro y cual celda ocupa.
end note
@enduml
